+---
+title: 'guarantor-autofill-fix'
+type: 'bugfix'
+created: '2026-08-05'
+status: 'in-progress'
+review_loop_iteration: 0
+baseline_commit: 'e0c4d8945f104cf871bb5f94e7bf957a828756fc'
