+**Acceptance Criteria:**
+- Given the apply form with a seeded vacancy, when the guarantor section is opened (required cohort or `has_guarantor` tick) and an autofill suggestion is clicked in a real Chromium, then `guarantor_phone` and `guarantor_employer` populate. **`guarantor_name` / `guarantor_email` are carved out of this AC by human ruling (2026-08-05):** Chromium's `kTypeValueFormFillingLimit = 9` caps fills at 9 fields per type per action counted across the whole form, and the guarantor name/email are the 10th NAME_FULL / 11th EMAIL instance on the page — a browser limitation, not a form defect. Carve-out acceptance: the fields carry correct `autocomplete` tokens and Chrome classifies them (suggestion popup appears); the residual fill suppression is accepted. Follow-up [B] (co-applicant-card de-dup) is scoped in deferred-work.
