+**Manual checks:**
+- Real-browser Chromium autofill: with a seeded autofill profile, open the form, tick `has_guarantor` (or use a required cohort), click into `guarantor_phone` / `guarantor_employer`, click the suggestion — fields populate (name/email are capped by Chromium's 9-per-type fill limit — see AC carve-out). Also verify a token-less field (e.g. `reason_for_moving`) shows no autofill dropdown.
+- Conditional logic: required cohort (first-time renter) renders fields expanded with no checkbox; optional cohort renders checkbox, fields hidden until ticked; untick hides and clears.
